Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(飞夫)上啊！泰坦尼克号式俯冲！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.33,0:00:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(飞夫)BOY，接下来轮到你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对九十九游马直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)游马君的生命值还剩3100。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而与之相对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚力迪亚的攻击力是3400。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是挨下那招，游马就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上要是有怪兽的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.94,0:00:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能用盖牌半不破
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可这样下去……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.51,0:00:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)不，还有办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.33,0:00:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永别了，BOY！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！发动陷阱卡，半不破！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以无效1只怪兽的破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将战斗伤害减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！ 可是 你场上没有怪兽……。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 没错。 所以我要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用半·破坏指定的对象是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚加利亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把对方的怪兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:03:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3400。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算减半也够你受的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怎么回事？ 这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}半·破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来应该是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让被攻击的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的怪兽不被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并把伤害减半的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 他的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.25,0:03:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海美)所以 以敌人的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.90,0:03:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚加利亚为对象发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让自己受到的伤害减半
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.71,0:03:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只用了效果呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个笨蛋男孩啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤多多多战士！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽通过把攻击力降低500{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就可以不用解放来召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着，发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.49,0:03:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超越·接收！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡只有在对手场上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存在怪兽超量时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.81,0:04:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌把与自己场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.39,0:04:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同等级的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，茶茶弓箭手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过通过这个效果特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力和守备力变为0效果无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级6的怪兽两只。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了哦，达令。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级6的怒怒怒战士和
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刷啦啦骑士构筑叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:32.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.55,0:04:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拉紧炽热的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}瞄准吧，加特林射手！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.08,0:04:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么嘛，阶级6？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的古斯塔夫·马克斯可是阶级10啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的那只不是已经被干掉了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经结束的事就别在那磨磨唧唧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，现在不是做无谓争斗的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:04:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.85,0:05:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量宝藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.05,0:05:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上每有1只超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上有2只超量怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我抽2张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我再发动加特林食人魔的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.22,0:05:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏1只怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.44,0:05:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就能打倒冈加里迪亚了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}射穿它吧，加特林食人魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目标是超巨大空中宫殿 冈加里迪亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.93,0:05:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡 超量反射！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.18,0:05:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡能让1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合既不会被战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不会被卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 甘加里迪亚的破坏就无效了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.04,0:05:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了 哈尼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.40,0:05:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甘加里迪亚是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和达令之间爱的结晶。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护它是理所当然的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的攻击还没结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甘特雷特·射手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对海美职业选手 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 艾克西斯·移动！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽的控制权交给队友{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并结束战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.99,0:06:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甘特雷特·射手的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了 达令。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护你是我的职责。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}达令。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.61,0:06:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)呀啊！ 太棒了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼此互相掩护的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝妙组合。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶——！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡，回合结束…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.36,0:06:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.79,0:06:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动，升阶魔法！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以通过解放
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽来发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.35,0:06:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我解放加特林·射手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从自己的墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:06:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤1只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！超重型炮塔列车古斯塔夫·最大！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且由于升阶魔法的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上升600！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.84,0:07:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样！这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就超过加加林迪亚的攻击力了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且用这个效果特殊召唤的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.87,0:07:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被卡的效果破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.05,0:07:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.61,0:07:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 又擅自拿我的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那枪管龙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是打不过枪炮龙的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:32.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也有 战…… 战……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:33.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战术。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.15,0:07:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！我有战术啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西我可没吃过。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之 现在别罗嗦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交给我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁放心交给你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《安娜酱什么都不懂……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗是通过互相碰撞彼此的心意{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让心与心相通的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.15,0:07:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是经历了无数场决斗才因此和飞夫先生……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当安娜酱对我说“请教我决斗”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.39,0:08:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我希望有一天安娜也能{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.57,0:08:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过决斗找到能心灵相通的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对象。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错……就算用那张
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}牺牲自己的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也能遇到觉得不可惜的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起进行人生的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}标签决斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是现在的安娜……》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底还不是因为你擅自用我的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有什么关系嘛规则就是这样啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我到此回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.24,0:08:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((安娜 什么都不懂……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.78,0:08:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此……))
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我来让你明白！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:08:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动等级提升魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 屏障之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.63,0:09:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 她也变成屏障了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 这场决斗绝不能输！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.27,0:09:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈妮… 那个额头到底是？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 那种魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是什么时候放进卡组的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.11,0:09:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将自己的怪兽超量升级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤混沌超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级10的冈加里迪亚进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.80,0:09:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以诞生于混沌之中的屏障之力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.32,0:09:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爱的宫殿如今 焕然重生！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 混沌超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.23,0:09:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超巨大空中要塞 巴比伦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:09:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这到底是什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.23,0:10:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？ 这个怪物。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.77,0:10:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动巴比伦的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1个混沌超量单元送去墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合可以攻击2次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.04,0:10:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能够进行攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.57,0:10:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多重连击！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙啊 游马。安娜剩下的生命值是2000。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}古斯塔夫·马克斯被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:19.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再受到直接攻击的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承受的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}她就完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好觉悟吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用巴比伦 攻击古斯塔夫·马克斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海美)命运·破坏者！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.61,0:10:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 倒挂眼镜！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 直到回合结束{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上所有怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.71,0:10:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力减半！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 为什么要为了我……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么为什么 搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救你不是理所当然的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}耍这种小聪明真有你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 发动巴比伦的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予那只怪兽攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一半的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承受900的伤害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}次级灾难！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没结束。我可以再攻击一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就是致命一击了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用巴比伦直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用巴比伦直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌特殊召唤金特鲁帕！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽在对方攻击过来时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌以攻击表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且只要金特鲁帕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.61,0:11:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽就必须
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击金特鲁帕！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了护住搭档甘当替身，真让人感动呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动巴比伦的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方怪兽攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一半的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}次级灾难！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，倒挂眼镜的效果就消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤无赖特急巴特雷恩！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.53,0:12:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用巴特雷恩对飞夫前辈直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.07,0:12:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！艾克西斯·移动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:12:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果，我将
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴比伦的控制权交给飞夫先生{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:02.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算其中一方被巴利安洗脑了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.03,0:13:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}组合的默契还是没变啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.36,0:13:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，发动巴特雷恩的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次，给对手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.47,0:13:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特急特急！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垂死挣扎。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.98,0:13:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐，你知道这种叫什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叫杯水车薪哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.73,0:13:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看看你搭档的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真可怜现在都快倒下了不是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了救你手牌也用光了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连守备怪兽都没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我好好看着哦。下一回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的伙伴被我们爱情的结晶残忍地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彻底地 体无完肤地踩得粉碎。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(飞夫)喂 喂 哈尼没必要做到这种地步吧…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}达令 你给我闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《安娜：游马…》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 把卡盖上 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:21.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}达令！我们爱情的力量让他们见识见识！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 好的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 使用一张混沌超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动巴比伦的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多重发射！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 对男孩直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.93,0:14:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去的话 游马他！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((就算现在还不明白{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.00,0:14:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天 你会明白的))
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法！ 献身的爱 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.74,0:15:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)哎！ 爱!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)这张卡是在这个回合结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把自己的生命值变成零作为代价{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.83,0:15:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让战斗结束
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让对方 抽１张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.13,0:15:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.16,0:15:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.16,0:15:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡的人 是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.49,0:15:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.61,0:15:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啦！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:36.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来是抽到了一张好卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.47,0:15:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.23,0:15:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:15:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来就交给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.51,0:16:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.01,0:16:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才 你抽到的卡是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你会有异晶界的卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 那个… 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从 从基拉古那里抢来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒那家伙的时候得到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.61,0:16:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 为什么要把那种卡放进卡组…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那个 就是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.53,0:16:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总 总之 现在是决斗中。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.76,0:16:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜 你的怪兽我可不会白白浪费！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.88,0:16:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 等级4的我我我魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发条鲨 叠放超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.82,0:16:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.06,0:16:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《霍普的攻击力是2500。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样可敌不过巴比伦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今……》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 难道你要用那张卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 就算是异晶人的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了赢下决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也只能用这家伙了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.66,0:17:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}限定异晶之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4阶以下的超量怪兽1只{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成比它阶级高1的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冠有混沌之名的超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使其进化！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将希望皇 霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.04,0:17:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身缠混沌之力 去夺取胜利吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进化后的英姿此刻 在此降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.87,0:17:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普雷V。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷V。这就是霍普进化后的姿态。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算升阶了攻击力终究也只有2600。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根本不是攻击力3800的巴比伦的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不好说？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.60,0:18:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动霍普雷V的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.20,0:18:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1张混沌超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏场上的1只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.85,0:18:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将其攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:49.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇霍普。破坏巴比伦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V字斩击。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 上了。 用希望皇霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对海美职业选手直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望剑 V字斩。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)成功了。 哇～ 哇～。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？ 甜心。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯… 嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你 达令。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.44,0:20:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你难得这么兴奋呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.65,0:20:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起。 从决斗中途开始
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我脑袋就嗡～地一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.13,0:20:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真讨厌。 为什么会那么…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得不错嘛，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？不继续决斗了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然要继续啊。不管发生什么{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.80,0:20:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能放弃决斗呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过呢得稍微休息一下就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.45,0:20:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为啊，我们爱情的结晶。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎哎！？难道说是小宝宝？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海美姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我完全不知道这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起哦。其实也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}故意瞒着你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过多亏了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.79,0:21:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天才能和安娜酱决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.67,0:21:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的很开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.45,0:21:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安娜酱能明白那张卡的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正含义{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.01,0:21:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也很高兴哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.91,0:21:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 那个是 那个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.63,0:21:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看 为了爱而直接攻击哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:26.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀呀…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.97,0:21:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等 等等… 要掉了 要掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《限定·屏障·之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让希望进化成希望莱V的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今后与屏障的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.93,0:21:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会变得越来越激烈吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.47,0:21:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那之中那东西一定会成为巨大的战力。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:02.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明如此 怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.34,0:22:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这份莫名其妙的忐忑不安究竟是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.44,0:23:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.66,0:23:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.30,0:23:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.05,0:23:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.62,0:23:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.78,0:23:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:23:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.21,0:24:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.11,0:24:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.49,0:24:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
